.com/v/t64.5771-25/75608435_365527989595014_5774173203706167909_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cdxT6JyLrSgQ7kNvwGds2qY&_nc_oc=Adr7xhqAhBDxxk-zHeA6B28t8zqXhZLmTQF6nmHHRRmvpJs9NX_MVe7fDrFcJzmmweM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT30cmCpLX6PZy54eHqwfgJ_7WcoIL0UaEso1bsZEr-jQ&oe=6B030696"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "1763608794160777", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982639_1763608797494110_9146144758691653845_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m266oGDml9EQ7kNvwE2Z-9c&_nc_oc=AdouklSn0Y_1a1MR2X4VrSiaQ8hOGZHv1-YGAagPJ-Zk1hBx-2V-zeJXnoZ-0AXZnlQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTi9UV1jKglE8jSW4_iTHVmHO_tlfrD2q0eAsK7Tzoqng&oe=6B03063A"}, "display_name": "CitrusBall", "keywords": [], "long_description": "From one backyard court to world-wide phenomenon, CitrusBall is the new sport everyone's talking about. Now the game\u2019s greatest are joining an exclusive tournament on a billionaire\u2019s mysterious private island. Who will be crowned as champion?\n\nIn CitrusBall, you select a powerful character with unique abilities to face off in a designed-for-VR sport inspired by tennis and pickleball.\n\nEarly access features:\n3 playable characters, each with a unique talent, special move, and \"game changer\"\n2 island locations to play single matches against a computer-controlled opponent\nTutorial covering basic gameplay and ability usage\n\nFuture roadmap:\n3 additional playable characters\nStory mode with new locations culminating in a boss battle\nMultiplayer", "short_description": "From one backyard court to world-wide phenomenon, CitrusBall is the new sport everyone's talking about. Now the game\u2019s greatest are joining an exclusive tournament on a billionaire\u2019s mysterious private island. Who will be crowned as champion?\n\nIn